<Placemark><name>Lunch: Trailside Cafe</name><description>Mile 47.1. 1807 Commerce St, Yorktown Heights, NY. (914) 302-7331. Beside the North County Trailway. Smoothies, paninis, wraps. Sunday hours listed as 8 AM to 3 or 4 PM (sources disagree): call ahead.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.78054,41.27065</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Hotel: Heidi's Inn</name><description>Mile 67.5. 1270 Route 22, Brewster, NY. (845) 279-8011. Motel on NY-22, about 3 mi past the end of the Putnam Trailway (through Brewster village). Confirm bike storage when booking.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.58022,41.40567</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Hotel: Comfort Inn Brewster</name><description>Mile 67.0, 1.1 mi off route. 7-11 Peach Lake Rd, Brewster, NY. (845) 363-0974. About 2 mi east of Brewster village near I-84. Free hot breakfast.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.58489,41.38536</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
