<Placemark><name>Lunch: Bread Alone Bakery &amp; Cafe</name><description>Mile 59.7. 45 E Market St, Rhinebeck, NY. . Breakfast and lunch daily; listed open Mondays 7 AM to 5 PM.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.91133,41.92746</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Hotel: Hudson Whaler Hotel (formerly The Barlow)</name><description>Mile 89.6. 542 Warren St, Hudson, NY. (518) 217-4334. The Barlow Hotel was sold and reopened as the Hudson Whaler: same building, new name and phone number.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.78506,42.24871</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Hotel: The Wick, Hudson (Tribute Portfolio)</name><description>Mile 88.9, 0.2 mi off route. 41 Cross St, Hudson, NY. (518) 249-6825. Near the Hudson Amtrak station.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.79604,42.25306</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Bike: Bikeway at Hopewell Depot</name><description>Mile 27.8. Hopewell Depot, Dutchess Rail Trail, Hopewell Junction, NY. (845) 463-4000. Seasonal rentals and repairs at the trailhead; main line is Bikeway's Wappingers Falls shop. Call for October hours.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.80699,41.58548</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Bike: Rhinebeck Bicycle Shop</name><description>Mile 59.9. 10 Garden St, Rhinebeck, NY. (845) 876-4025. Repairs, parts, rentals. One block from Bread Alone. Call for hours.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.91388,41.92749</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Bike: Steiner's Sports</name><description>Mile 89.2. 301 Warren St, Hudson, NY. (518) 828-5063. Bike sales and service. Listed Mon to Fri 10 to 6, Sat 10 to 5, Sun from 11.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.79132,42.25278</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
