<Placemark><name>Lunch: Don &amp; Paul's Coffee Shoppe</name><description>Mile 52.0. 68 Broad St, Waterford, NY. . Diner on the route by the Waterford canal harbor. Listed Mon to Sat 7 AM to 7:30 PM, Sun 7 AM to 2 PM.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.67877,42.79009</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Hotel: Dovegate Inn</name><description>Mile 76.9. 184 Broad St, Schuylerville, NY. (518) 695-3699. Small inn with a few rooms on Broad St in Schuylerville village, with an on-site restaurant (Kitchen at the Dovegate Inn, 518-695-6095). Book early: limited rooms. Ask about bike storage.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.57966,43.10274</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Bike: Steiner's Sports (Valatie)</name><description>Mile 15.5, 0.5 mi off route. 3455 Route 9, Valatie, NY. (518) 784-3663. In Valatie, just off the AHET around mile 15. Listed Mon to Wed 10 to 6, Thu and Fri 10 to 8, Sat 9 to 5, Sun 11 to 4.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.67000,42.41800</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Station: Albany-Rensselaer</name><description>Mile 37.5, 0.1 mi off route.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.74129,42.64125</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
</Folder>
