<Placemark><name>Lunch: Stewart's Shops #211</name><description>Mile 38.4, 0.3 mi off route. 60 Poultney St, Whitehall, NY. . Convenience store with hot food and coffee. The reliable food stop in Whitehall.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.39814,43.54997</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Hotel: Best Western Plus Ticonderoga Inn &amp; Suites</name><description>Mile 64.4. 260 Burgoyne Rd, Ticonderoga, NY. (518) 585-2378. On the south side of town, right on the route.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.42782,43.85829</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Bike: Walker's Farm, Home &amp; Tack</name><description>Mile 25.4, 0.2 mi off route. 5565 State Route 4, Fort Ann, NY. (518) 639-5223. Farm and hardware store, NOT a bike shop: basic tools and supplies only. Listed Mon to Fri 8 to 6, Sat 8 to 5, Sun 9 to 4.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.49100,43.41500</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Bike: Rick's Bike Shop</name><description>Mile 15.3, 4.7 mi off route. 368 Ridge Rd, Queensbury, NY. (518) 793-8986. Full shop, but about 5 mi west of the route near Fort Edward. Mon to Fri 10 to 6, Sat 10 to 5, closed Sun.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.63583,43.33163</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Station: Fort Edward-Glens Falls</name><description>Mile 13.2, 0.1 mi off route.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.58040,43.26976</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Station: Whitehall</name><description>Mile 38.6, 0.0 mi off route.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.40323,43.55477</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
