<Placemark><name>Lunch: Pink Pig Cafe</name><description>Mile 38.4. 2750 Essex Rd, Essex, NY. (518) 962-8833. Next to the ferry dock. Hours are limited in the fall (one listing shows Fri to Sun hours and closed Mon to Wed; Thursday is unclear): call ahead. The Essex Ice Cream Cafe is summer-only, and 'The Cup Cafe' from earlier drafts does not appear to exist.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.35154,44.31005</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Hotel: Best Western Plus Plattsburgh</name><description>Mile 72.5. 446 Route 3, Plattsburgh, NY. (518) 561-7750. On Route 3 by I-87 exit 37, about 2 mi west of downtown.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.49193,44.69771</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Bike: Maui North Ski, Bike &amp; Board</name><description>Mile 71.7, 0.2 mi off route. 316 Cornelia St, Plattsburgh, NY. (518) 563-7245. Full-service shop on the route into town. Listed Mon to Fri 10 to 6, Sat 10 to 5, Sun 12 to 4.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.47864,44.69935</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Food: Stewart's Shops #103</name><description>Mile 15.0. 4308 Main St, Port Henry, NY. (518) 546-3025. Guaranteed food and water on Day 5. Top up here.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.45925,44.04761</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Food: Stewart's Shops</name><description>Mile 55.9, 0.2 mi off route. 1774 Main St, Keeseville, NY. . Backup food stop on the route in Keeseville.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.48346,44.50652</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Station: Port Henry</name><description>Mile 14.6, 0.1 mi off route.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.45883,44.04233</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Station: Westport</name><description>Mile 25.6, 0.8 mi off route.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.45189,44.18717</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Station: Plattsburgh</name><description>Mile 70.3, 0.2 mi off route.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.44645,44.69672</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
