<Placemark><name>Lunch: Lakeside Coffee Roasters</name><description>Mile 28.1. 109 Lake St, Rouses Point, NY. (518) 297-5600. Last US cafe before the border. Paninis, quiche, soups. Listed Tue to Fri 7:30 AM to 2 PM (one source says Fri closes 1:30), Sat and Sun 8 to 2, closed Mon. The Lake Street Cafe &amp; Bakery listed in earlier drafts closed in Oct 2025.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.36424,44.99315</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Hotel: Quality Hotel Centre de Congrès</name><description>Mile 54.7. 725 Boul. du Séminaire N, Saint-Jean-sur-Richelieu, QC. +1 (450) 300-5177. North side of town, near the canal. Choice Hotels toll-free: 1-800-667-3815.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.26641,45.32482</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Hotel: Auberge Harris</name><description>Mile 54.4. 576 Rue Champlain, Saint-Jean-sur-Richelieu, QC. +1 (450) 348-3821. Riverside inn close to the start of the canal path. Toll-free 1-800-668-3821.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.26475,45.32391</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Bike: Cycle LM</name><description>Mile 54.7, 2.4 mi off route. 270 Boul. Saint-Luc, Saint-Jean-sur-Richelieu, QC. . Bike shop with a repair workshop, about 2.4 mi west of the route. Replaces 'Performance Bégin', which could not be found. Phone not verified: see cyclelm.com.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.29597,45.35408</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>BORDER: Rouses Point–Lacolle 223</name><description>Mile 29.4. Open 8 AM to 8 PM daily (both sides). Passport, EDL or NEXUS. No cannabis.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.37086,45.01030</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Station: Plattsburgh</name><description>Mile 4.3, 0.2 mi off route.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.44645,44.69672</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Station: Rouses Point</name><description>Mile 28.3, 0.3 mi off route.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.37117,44.99500</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
</Folder>
