<Placemark><name>Lunch: Boulangerie du Vieux-Chambly</name><description>Mile 13.8, 0.2 mi off route. 2403 Av. Bourgogne, Chambly, QC. +1 (450) 447-9991. Bakery and cafe on the route, about 0.5 mi before Fort Chambly. Sandwiches and pastries. Replaces Fourquet Fourchette, which has closed.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.26440,45.44423</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Hotel: Hôtel Monville</name><description>Mile 35.5, 0.4 mi off route. 1041 Rue de Bleury, Montréal, QC. +1 (514) 379-2000. Downtown, about 0.5 mi from Place Jacques-Cartier. Ask about bike storage when booking.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.56234,45.50447</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Hotel: Fairmont The Queen Elizabeth</name><description>Mile 35.3, 0.7 mi off route. 900 Boul. René-Lévesque O, Montréal, QC. +1 (514) 861-3511. Above Gare Centrale. Unboxed bikes still cannot board Amtrak here.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.56848,45.50020</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Bike: Ça Roule Montréal / Montreal on Wheels</name><description>Mile 35.6. 27 Rue de la Commune E, Montréal, QC. +1 (514) 866-0633. Rental and repair shop at the finish in Old Montreal. October hours listed 10 AM to 5 PM daily.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.55314,45.50583</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Bike: Bicycles Quilicot (Villeray)</name><description>Mile 35.8, 3.8 mi off route. 7341 Rue Saint-Denis, Montréal, QC. +1 (514) 303-4118. Full shop, 4 mi north of downtown. Call ahead to confirm bike boxes are available.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.61759,45.53945</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Bike: MEC Montréal (Marché Central)</name><description>Mile 35.8, 5.5 mi off route. 8989 Boul. de l'Acadie, Montréal, QC. +1 (514) 788-5878. Outdoor store with bike service. Earlier drafts gave a Saint-Denis address; that is wrong.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.66200,45.53030</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Station: Longueuil–Université-de-Sherbrooke</name><description>Mile 28.8, 0.1 mi off route.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.52192,45.52493</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
